{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10006_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:645450afab3af7403bd72eb47fafd0dbb5f825e4a3c38a56e92b2c76ee568d48",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb51231d3c26f3aef8eb4b187b5d9145166d6d7c5d9f4a2beb6a55cf4dfbbc2c",
      "text": "说是长大以后，想变得像花音他们一样呢。\n诶嘿嘿，超级开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75af4b96254a153672951340abce6efb33e2f4a23cc8cceb6a4e42f9777c2324",
      "text": "嗯。能被他们那样看待，\n真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f764c767ff0ec78d6d7af2609d810667ea6571301859f6cb135cf70135414fa",
      "text": "说起来……你们两个，将来想成为什么样的人啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c574dff3254230b13094a65c9ac4281d5b3773bf8cee8559bbe09c8f566c9e83",
      "text": "我当然是要成为世界第一的舞者啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9f66d7af334fa5018bc3f4c83c4d46f2ffdb7162631b25c2c4d3c4dea9721d5",
      "text": "花音要成为世界上最可爱的偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee121d2e1306a9b6e2586272ba1d0fa241cc8f7613561ffb98195339bff1b35c",
      "text": "我……以前的梦想是成为普通的上班族呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:022c1bdbce21a5de4ca8f20b55d4782663d7a2ba0d4fd63b2c661d5f6ec82d39",
      "text": "啊——直央的话确实会这么想呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad44234f8dd8c4f482705649f2d202391b201d691f51cb84660a43601c81a3aa",
      "text": "不过，真想象不出长大以后的直央会是什么样子啊。\n花音也是一样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2a8fa7bfe7cb65ff23041158208c96b8e4e6aeadf9ee899f2d1ecfb89d1d92",
      "text": "哼。才不要呢，根本不需要变成大人。\n花音只要一直做可爱的小孩子就好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0dbd05d068cc3defe376245e8803274a94dad01567d1d71a42379b840146fada",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n哪有人不会变成大人的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6c2560403ed4915520de1cdd631de6af0076bcef0c2d0086a2c52a3a6622e1",
      "text": "就、有嘛。我在图画书里看过的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67ed3a0a432d1f3a0a9c12ca736f0445959b3b608c476bf9030ab61e1ff411b8",
      "text": "图画书是图画书吧？\n大家总有一天都会变成大人的啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10006_01:1_3_10006_01_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6664b9eb5d8fac56655e34ec164c43328aa92bf7ef545a551743e6b7bc407890",
      "text": "但、但是，花音……呜呜～～……！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
